WEBVTT

00:00:04.877 --> 00:00:09.387
At the top of the screen, the status tells you whether your work has been sent.

00:00:09.387 --> 00:00:13.155
All saved means that everything is already in your district sheet.

00:00:13.955 --> 00:00:16.215
When there is no signal, keep working.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:22.104
The app saves everything on your phone, and the status shows how many items are waiting to be sent.

00:00:22.904 --> 00:00:25.953
When the signal returns, open the Account tab.

00:00:25.953 --> 00:00:28.869
It shows how many items are waiting to send.

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:32.845
Tap, Send and refresh now, and the number goes back to zero.

00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:36.851
To sign out, open the Account tab and tap, Sign out.

00:00:36.851 --> 00:00:41.412
When everything has been sent, the learner list is removed from the phone.

00:00:41.412 --> 00:00:43.693
It comes back when you sign in again.

00:00:44.493 --> 00:00:48.554
If something is still waiting to be sent, the app asks you first.

00:00:48.554 --> 00:00:54.176
If you sign out anyway, the unsent work stays on that phone until you sign in on it again.

00:00:54.176 --> 00:00:56.675
So please wait until everything is sent.

00:00:57.475 --> 00:01:05.686
Remember that your daily time record and your accomplishment report are in a different app, the ARAL Tutor Engagement App.

00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:10.061
In the Account tab, tap, Open DTR and Accomplishment, to open it.

00:01:10.061 --> 00:01:14.234
It has its own sign in, with its own reference number and PIN.

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:16.589
The link is also on the video page.

00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:18.463
Some quick tips.

00:01:18.463 --> 00:01:21.148
Choose the right grade for each learner.

00:01:21.148 --> 00:01:23.296
Record every try on a worksheet.

00:01:23.296 --> 00:01:26.183
Keep your tutor code and your PIN on paper.

00:01:26.183 --> 00:01:29.002
Send your data whenever there is a signal.

00:01:29.002 --> 00:01:30.680
And never share your PIN.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.567
That is all you need to use the ARAL Gain Tracker.

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:37.839
If you have questions, ask your district coordinator.

00:01:37.839 --> 00:01:40.803
Thank you, tutor, for helping our learners grow.
